  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's perception and actuation capabilities, separating sensing and motion. The specification binds sensor outcomes to safe, progress-oriented actions: forward or random_walk in clear, directed turns on side obstacles, and a brief backward recovery only for front obstacles. The design ensures safety by requiring recovery before resuming exploration, and biases toward forward progress and coverage.",
